  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "The given lines are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></math><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/a9fb1b8e-216c-4f88-9316-7c2a9ffa73cc.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:2.46042in;height:1.74653in\" /><br />Hence, the bounded area <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math>&nbsp;sq. units",
